    "long_instructions": "## Investigate\r\n\r\nRun the code again and look closely at how it works.\r\n\r\n1. Trace the code.\r\n\r\n2. Add a comment explaining what `randint(1, 6)` does.\r\n\r\n3. Run the program 5 more times.\r\n\r\n4. Add a comment explaining why the output can change each time.",
